              "newText": "MarketSite.net Access Fee: Due upon Software Acceptance, and on each annual anniversary of Software Acceptance thereafter; provided that Corio may discontinue or reduce its MarketSite.net Service access upon thirty (30) days' written notice to Commerce One, in which case no further MarketSite.net Access Fee shall accrue for the discontinued or reduced access and any prepaid fees shall be trued up and refunded on a pro rata basis, without penalty or shortfall charge."
